      "claim": "Renewable energy sources are natural resources that replenish on a human time‑scale (e.g., wind, solar, hydro, sustainably managed biomass).",
      "evidence": "Standard science definitions (e.g., U.S. DOE, IPCC) list wind, solar, hydro, and sustainably harvested biomass as renewable.",
